_.SAVEAS _2010 "rasters-r2010.dwg"
_.SAVEAS _2007 "rasters-r2007.dwg"
_.SAVEAS _2004 "rasters-r2004.dwg"
_.SAVEAS _2000 "rasters-r2000.dwg"
_.SAVEAS _R14 "rasters-r14.dwg"
_.DXFOUT "rasters-r2018.dxf" _V _2018 16
_.DXFOUT "rasters-r2013.dxf" _V _2013 16
_.DXFOUT "rasters-r2010.dxf" _V _2010 16
_.DXFOUT "rasters-r2007.dxf" _V _2007 16
